### POST request to create an invoice
POST http://localhost:8000/api/billing/invoices
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "hospitalId": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111",
  "patientId": "123e4567-e89b-12d3-a456-426614174000",
  "appointmentId": "55555555-5555-5555-5555-555555555555",
  "invoiceType": "CONSULTATION",
  "discountAmount": 0,
  "taxAmount": 0,
  "items": [
    {
      "itemName": "General consultation",
      "itemType": "CONSULTATION_FEE",
      "quantity": 1,
      "unitAmount": 700
    }
  ]
}
